findings.fix:
Create a least-privilege role:
```sql
CREATE ROLE app_user WITH LOGIN PASSWORD 'strong_password';
GRANT SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE ON cards, payments TO app_user;
```
Use `postgres://app_user:...@db:5432/app` in DATABASE_URL. Also fix the vendor default password `postgres:postgres` (Req 2.2.2).

Add a masking helper:
```ts
const maskPan = (pan: string) => pan.slice(0,6) + '******' + pan.slice(-4);
logger.info('processing payment', { pan: maskPan(req.body.pan) });
```
Sweep the whole payment path: `grep -r 'logger\|console\.log' src/payments/`
